the amount of money that we're claiming  we made in all the press  now the sixth film is set to begin  production this summer with directing  duo matt bettinelli open and tyler  gillette who helmed the previous movie  the film will see returning sequel stars  jenna ortega melissa barrera and hayden  panettiere returning for the upcoming  slasher  [Music]
 

